{
  "html": "<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"r\" style=\"grid-column:1/13;grid-row:1/2\">\n    <div class=\"kicker\">02 · 场景价值决定投入优先级</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"r\" style=\"grid-column:1/6;grid-row:2/6\">\n    <div class=\"t1\">北汽福田AI设计使零部件4减至1</div>\n    <div class=\"b mut\">AI辅助设计可加快方案迭代与仿真，并直接改善产品性能。</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"r\" style=\"grid-column:1/6;grid-row:6/9\">\n    <div class=\"call\">管理层应优先在工程约束明确、可仿真验证的设计任务中投入AI试点。</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"r\" style=\"grid-column:6/13;grid-row:2/9\">\n    <div class=\"ledger\">\n      <div class=\"li\">\n        <div class=\"fig w red\">4→1</div>\n        <div class=\"r gap0\">\n          <div class=\"b bold\">零部件数量</div>\n          <div class=\"c\">北汽福田应用AI找到最佳设计路径，将原结构的4个零件变为1个。</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"li\">\n        <div class=\"fig\">70%</div>\n        <div class=\"r gap0\">\n          <div class=\"b bold\">产品轻量化</div>\n          <div class=\"c\">通过AI设计路径优化，解决原结构过重问题，产品重量减轻70%。</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"li\">\n        <div class=\"fig\">18.8%</div>\n        <div class=\"r gap0\">\n          <div class=\"b bold\">结构强度</div>\n          <div class=\"c\">零部件整合与轻量化的同时，产品强度增强18.8%。</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"li\">\n        <div class=\"fig n\">—</div>\n        <div class=\"r gap0\">\n          <div class=\"b bold\">设计快速迭代</div>\n          <div class=\"c\">人工智能辅助设计软件可根据市场需求快速迭代产品设计。</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"li\">\n        <div class=\"fig n\">—</div>\n        <div class=\"r gap0\">\n          <div class=\"b bold\">仿真效率提升</div>\n          <div class=\"c\">人工智能辅助设计软件可大幅提升仿真效率，增强市场竞争力。</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"source\">资料来源：中国信息通信研究院《人工智能发展报告（2024年）》第 42 页</div>\n  <div class=\"pageno\">11</div>\n</div>",
